# Bulwark Ox: Saddle 1 is refused with only Aegis Turtle (power 0) to tap. Then Savannah Lions saddles the Ox, whose attack trigger puts its counter on Bot1's own Lions
# (3/2); "Sacrifice this creature: Creatures you control with counters on them gain hexproof and indestructible until end of turn" gives the Lions both keywords
# (CR 702.11, 702.12) but not the Turtle, which has no counter, and the keywords are gone on turn 5 (CR 611.2a) while the counter stays.

